Note on hardware design files: the schematic, PCB, and enclosure sources in
`electrical/`, `bom/`, and `mechanical/` are licensed under the same terms
above for convenience. If you want hardware-specific protections (for
example, a copyleft requirement on physical derivatives), consider relicensing
those directories under a hardware-specific license such as the CERN Open
Hardware Licence (CERN-OHL-S or CERN-OHL-W) instead, and update this notice
and `README.md` accordingly. This project has not made that change; everything
in this repository is currently offered under the MIT terms above.
